        "content": "## ShopifyProductAdd.V2 \u2014 Import checklist\n\n1. Reconnect: Google Sheets, Shopify, Photoroom header auth\n2. HTTP Request1 (ImgBB): replace REPLACE_IMGBB_KEY after EVERY re-import\n3. Flow: Photoroom \u2192 **Analyze image (binary)** \u2192 Restore image binary \u2192 ImgBB \u2192 AI listing\n4. Analyze uses Photoroom file bytes \u2014 NOT ImgBB URL (OpenAI cannot fetch i.ibb.co reliably)\n5. Trigger watches **Price** on sheet **product_template**\n6. Fill sheet input first \u2192 see yellow sticky note **Sheet Input Data**\n7. IF score < 90 \u2192 FAIL | score >= 90 \u2192 Shopify draft\n8. Shopify: create draft \u2192 Prepare image \u2192 **Upload image to Shopify** (ImgBB src URL, HTTP + OAuth) \u2192 price/SKU \u2192 sheet\n9. Product category: type plain text (Casual Wear) \u2014 never =Casual Wear (sheet formula error)\n10. Store subdomain 8kqexi-2j (change URLs if your store differs)"
      },
