      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ONE SHEET ONLY \u2014 product_template\n\nYou do NOT need a second spreadsheet.\n\n### YOU type (before run):\n| Column | Required? |\n| Product image URL | YES |\n| Description or Title | YES |\n| Price | YES (trigger) |\n| SKU | YES |\n| Vendor, Product category | recommended |\n\n### ADD 2 new column headers (row 1, end of sheet):\n| QA Status | AI Score |\n| (leave empty) | (leave empty) |\nWorkflow fills these automatically.\n\n### QA Status values (workflow writes):\n| Value | Meaning |\n| PASS | Score >= 90, draft + image on Shopify CDN |\n| PASS_NO_IMAGE | Score >= 90, draft but image missing |\n| FAIL | Score < 90, no Shopify product |\n\nColumn order does NOT matter. Header names matter."
      },
